        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><strong>Click Cluck</strong> is a light-hearted desktop companion featuring a curious little chicken that roams freely across your screen. Much like a small pet wandering around the house, it moves, pecks, naps, and occasionally lays eggs. This adds a playful and unpredictable touch to your workspace. Whether you are working, studying, or taking a break, Click Cluck brings warmth, charm, and a bit of humor to your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>A lively 2D chicken</strong> that walks, runs, pecks, and rests on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 <strong>Lightweight transparent overlay</strong> that runs smoothly over any window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cozy and charming design</strong> that adds personality to your PC without distracting you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Philosophy:</strong><br>Click Cluck behaves like a tiny digital pet, quiet, curious, and a little mischievous. It does not need attention or commands. It simply lives on your screen and creates a soothing, delightful atmosphere.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><strong>Click Cluck</strong> is a light-hearted desktop companion featuring a curious little chicken that roams freely across your screen. Much like a small pet wandering around the house, it moves, pecks, naps, and occasionally lays eggs. This adds a playful and unpredictable touch to your workspace. Whether you are working, studying, or taking a break, Click Cluck brings warmth, charm, and a bit of humor to your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>A lively 2D chicken</strong> that walks, runs, pecks, and rests on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 <strong>Lightweight transparent overlay</strong> that runs smoothly over any window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cozy and charming design</strong> that adds personality to your PC without distracting you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Philosophy:</strong><br>Click Cluck behaves like a tiny digital pet, quiet, curious, and a little mischievous. It does not need attention or commands. It simply lives on your screen and creates a soothing, delightful atmosphere.</p>",
        "short_description": "A curious desktop chicken that wanders your screen, pecks around, naps peacefully, and brings cozy charm to your workspace.",
